"""$class_name: TODO one line describing the target infrastructure.

Starter implementation: an echo adapter that already passes the shared provider contract,
so you always start from green. Replace the marked TODOs, keep the rules:

* Implement ``stream_execute`` (async generator) and ``health_check`` only; the base class
  derives ``execute``.
* Yield events with ``seq=0`` and finish with exactly one DONE event.
* On failure RAISE a domain ``ProviderError`` subclass (see errors.py); never end silently.
